Problem
Meridian Electronic's customer support team currently handles customer inquiries MANUALLY. 
This approach is time-consuming and error-prone.
They do this by Phone and Email, this tell us customer want human like experience.

Solution
We will build an AI Powered chatbot that can handle customer inquiries automatically. The chatbot will be able to handle customer inquiries 24/7 and will be able to handle a large number of customers.
The chatbot must allow customers do the following:
-checking product availability
-helping customers place orders
-looking up order history
-authenticating returning customers

What we already have:
MCP Server from backend team, available here: 
MCP_SERVER_URL=https://order-mcp-74afyau24q-uc.a.run.app/mcp
Transport: Streamable HTTP

Strategy:
Build a working prototype first


Tech Stack
OpenAI Agent SDK for building the chatbot
Model: gpt-4o-mini (a good balance of cost and performance)
Gradio for UI
deployment on Hugging Face Spaces

Immediate Next Steps:
1. setup minimal ui with gradio that allows users to chat with the chatbot
2. setup the MCP client to talk to the MCP server
3. setup the chatbot to use the MCP client
4. test the chatbot
5. deploy the chatbot to Hugging Face Spaces


Possible Challenges:
1. MCP server is not always available,reliable, be defensive about it
2. Tool looping and memory management in chatbot is tricky, be careful about it
3. Test deployment on Hugging Face Spaces as early as possible to see if libraries will be supported


